{"id":"659964","name":"肉末酸豆角","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/659964/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"酸豆角","amount":"1把"},{"name":"肉末","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜末","amount":"5g"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"5g"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"10g"},{"name":"辣椒碎","amount":"5g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"酸豆角。","img":"images/659964/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"肉末、姜未、蒜未、葱花、辣椒碎。","img":"images/659964/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"酸豆角清洗干净后切成粒。","img":"images/659964/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"洗锅热油，倒入姜蒜末。","img":"images/659964/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入肉粒炒熟。","img":"images/659964/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入酱油、蚝油调味。","img":"images/659964/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入辣椒碎炒香。","img":"images/659964/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入酸豆角翻炒。","img":"images/659964/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入一匙糖提鲜。","img":"images/659964/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"最后撒入葱花即可。","img":"images/659964/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。夏天的下饭神器。","img":"images/659964/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}